    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Workflow name\nAccess and input gateway *(Workflow 1)*\n\n### Owner\n\nIslam Hegazy\n\n### Purpose\nGive access only to the authenticated users and transcribe the audio input. \n\n### Trigger\nSending a message to the telegram bot\n\n### Input\ndoctor ID, chat ID, the sent message itself (text/ voice note/ audio file)\n\n### Steps\n1- Human/ bot check.\n2- Authentication check.\n3- Detection of the message type (text/ voice note/ audio)\n4- Transcribing the audio.\n5- Normalize into user message.\n\n### AI component \nSpeech transcription (through a transcription model)\n\n### Tools and data sources\n1- Telegram (trigger/ action)\n2- Postgres SQL\n3- Role based routing nodes (If/ Switch)\n4- Gemini transcription model\n\n### Output\nAuthorized normalized requests with doctor and session metadata.\n\n### Risk tier\nMedium\n\n### Human approval point\nNo clinical output released; unauthorized/bot requests stop before AI processing.\n\n### If it fails\nReject unsupported input; deny unauthorized users; return a safe message.\n\n### Logging and tracing\nLog user/session ID, input type, authentication result, transcription status. \nTrace in LangSmith once enabled.\n\n### Test cases\n",
        "height": 896,
        "width": 646
      },
